    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. sometimes though it feels like they just have this weird, mischievous energy, like they're doing it just to cause chaos or mess with the staff. do you have any advice for handling those specific kinds of disruptive personalities that just won't settle down?",
      "source": "evaluator"
